<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch Nov consumer spending rises 3.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Dutch Nov consumer spending rises 3.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch consumer spending rose 3.1 percent in volume terms in November 1996 compared to the same month of 1995, the Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said.</p>
<p>Consumer spending rose 3.3 percent from January until November 1996, the CBS said.</p>
<p> DUTCH CONSUMER SPENDING     Nov 1996    Oct 1996   Jan-Nov 1996</p>
<p>yr-on-yr pct volume changes</p>
<p> Total consumer spending	 3.1	   5.0	  3.3</p>
<p>  - food, beverages, tobacco   6.2	   9.3	  3.3</p>
<p>  - durable goods		  2.1	   8.2	  4.5</p>
<p>  - other goods and services   2.8	   3.2	  3.0</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 570 8500</p>
